    <briefdescription>
<para>Helps unique <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_d_i_e_abbrev" kindref="compound">DIEAbbrev</ref> objects and assigns abbreviation numbers. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class will unique the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_d_i_e" kindref="compound">DIE</ref> abbreviations for a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_d_i_e" kindref="compound">llvm::DIE</ref> object and assign a unique abbreviation number to each unique <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_d_i_e_abbrev" kindref="compound">DIEAbbrev</ref> object it finds. The resulting collection of <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_d_i_e_abbrev" kindref="compound">DIEAbbrev</ref> objects can then be emitted into the .debug_abbrev section. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
